{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大号粉色文字“心里又热了起来”，随后注意到下方橙色大字“有了劲头”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。能感到人物状态发生了积极变化，但不知道具体处境。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"重新燃起热情、振作起来、有劲头、积极向前。\",\n  \"missed\": \"右上角目录中的“不念着回头先把日子过好”暗示了人物放下过去、重新生活的背景；下方小字补充了心跳、音乐快速推进，以及结尾和弦可能象征决定或骤然醒来的含义。第一眼不容易拿到这些信息。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"放大的词本身说不出处境：能看出情绪和动力变强，但不知道人物经历了什么。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：人物的背景线索在右上角目录，情绪在左上角大字，音乐推进和情绪变化的联系在下方说明文字，需要拼接才能理解。\",\n    \"右上角目录字号较小，四条文字连续排列，需要额外扫读才能找到当前阶段及其背景。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4ef2eb7d-faa5-4433-b468-7949568a0ce5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T024204563726Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:42:24.382862+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0fc2611a0f1987722c1309e7b97c42bf771d7705232a6791f3ad0122a227d897", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f